            <ArticleTitle>Increased patchy renal accumulation of 99mTc-methylene diphosphonate in a patient with severe loin pain after exercise.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>29-31</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Radionuclide imaging in a patient who had acute renal failure with severe loin pain and patchy renal vasoconstriction is described. The patient was studied 3h after the intravenous bolus injection of 25 mCi99mTc-methylene diphosphonate (99mTc-MDP). An intense patchy renal concentration of 99mTc-MDP was observed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
